The login/logout control disappeared because your custom `api.html` template likely overrides the `userlinks` block without including the default authentication links.

The `userlinks` block in the browsable API base template contains the login/logout links by default [1]. When you override this block in your template, you replace the default content. To preserve the authentication links while adding your own, you must use `{{ block.super }}` within the `userlinks` block in your `api.html` file [1].

Example of how to preserve the links:

```html
{% block userlinks %}
    {{ block.super }}
    <li><a href="...">Your Custom Link</a></li>
{% endblock %}
```

